  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Wendy Ferguson is a British investor with interests in Linton Investments and Beauty Group London. She shares control of Linton, a Scottish family investment business that supplies capital to privately held companies. Its portfolio spans hospitality, drinks and industrial services, while Beauty Group London develops and markets branded fragrances for international consumers.",
    "html": "<p>Wendy Ferguson is a British investor with interests in Linton Investments and Beauty Group London. She shares control of Linton, a Scottish family investment business that supplies capital to privately held companies. Its portfolio spans hospitality, drinks and industrial services, while Beauty Group London develops and markets branded fragrances for international consumers.</p>\r\n",
