  "long_biography": {
    "plain_text": "Wendy Ferguson has supported youth sport in Aberdeenshire through the Inverurie Youth Sports Foundation. She and Steven Ferguson backed its aim of helping young people in the Garioch area develop through sport. The foundation accepts funding applications from individuals and clubs, addressing practical costs that can prevent participation.\n\nIts ACTIVE programme funded club fees and equipment and worked with Kellands School to introduce pupils to six local sports. Coaches delivered taster sessions during the school day, including judo, athletics and gymnastics. The foundation also helped Aberdeen Amateur Athletics Club buy a frame running bike.",
    "html": "<p>Wendy Ferguson has supported youth sport in Aberdeenshire through the Inverurie Youth Sports Foundation. She and Steven Ferguson backed its aim of helping young people in the Garioch area develop through sport. The foundation accepts funding applications from individuals and clubs, addressing practical costs that can prevent participation.</p>\r\n<p>Its ACTIVE programme funded club fees and equipment and worked with Kellands School to introduce pupils to six local sports. Coaches delivered taster sessions during the school day, including judo, athletics and gymnastics. The foundation also helped Aberdeen Amateur Athletics Club buy a frame running bike.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 94,
